<blockquote class="uncited"><div>I'm currently using the OpenGD77 firmware version 20241215112702 with DM 1701, which doesn't appear to have the "Last Heard Callsign" feature displayed on the screen. Could you please let me know which firmware version includes support for that feature?</div></blockquote>The Last Head functionality has been in the firmware for several years.<br><br>Note. Obviously this only works on DMR and only if you have the callsign database loaded.<br>Brandmeister sends the callsign slowly during the reception so the database is not absolutely essential<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sat Jul 19, 2025 6:35 am</p><hr />
